{"ratings":[{"id":"C1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"normal","reason":"A normally merged run can be reported as needing review because status ignores its confirmed merge flag."},{"id":"C2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"An external push after acknowledgement can make an approval stale without the digest surfacing the resulting review work."},{"id":"C3","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"The digest asks for review while a requested changes round is queued or running."},{"id":"C4","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A policy-file read error silently removes the requested state and next action from the status response."},{"id":"C5","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A historical blocked landing causes status to recommend retrying even after the work is closed or resolved."},{"id":"C6","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"An approval recorded before the first saved PR snapshot is incorrectly listed as needing review."},{"id":"C7","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"unusual","reason":"An exceptionally long saved question can consume a large amount of session context despite the digest's line cap."},{"id":"C10","consequence":"test","trigger":"normal","reason":"The required check fails formatting validation before typechecking and tests run."},{"id":"C11","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"An approval submitted during an active changes round hides that work and directs the agent toward landing."},{"id":"C12","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"normal","reason":"Following the Codex skill's session-start command reads Claude's consumer cursor and can miss Codex's unread work."},{"id":"C14","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"normal","reason":"MCP review approvals are recorded and announced as made by a human, misrepresenting their provenance."}]}